  "description": "Cowboy is a rugged and bold display font inspired by the spirit of the Wild West. With sharp serifs and a strong vintage aesthetic, this font is perfect for Western-themed projects, branding, signage, posters, film titles, and merchandise. Cowboy brings a rustic edge to your designs while maintaining readability and impact. Whether you’re crafting an outlaw poster or an old saloon sign, this font evokes grit, adventure, and frontier charm.",
